      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-f6c3d72a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法所称流动资金贷款，是指贷款人向法人或非法人组织（按照国家有关规定不得办理银行贷款的主体除外）发放的，用于借款人日常经营周转的本外币贷款。",
      "quoteHash": "f6c3d72a7b7ab1cfe3938ec045b897e9f63d4456b62e7769be9b1d5fe3822844",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-abb174af",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人开展流动资金贷款业务，应当遵循依法合规、审慎经营、平等自愿、公平诚信的原则。",
      "quoteHash": "abb174af5c97c59c7225d6027f07814ae9651048b5d6676a90b43ade29cdaa98",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-5c7215c1",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应完善内部控制机制，实行贷款全流程管理，全面了解客户信息，建立流动资金贷款风险管理制度和有效的岗位制衡机制，将贷款管理各环节的责任落实到具体部门和岗位，并建立各岗位的考核和问责机制。",
      "quoteHash": "5c7215c1947b4c61055c8a04fb1036cf87575f9a793273f1edd6fccb65b22b40",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-9af103c7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "流动资金贷款利率应当遵循利率市场化原则，由借贷双方在遵守国家有关规定的前提下协商确定。",
      "quoteHash": "9af103c7c98557edb148bf2714b437e97b6b291c26c3b981b2ce328510c54d4c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-0a441ec6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0014",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "流动资金贷款申请应具备以下条件：",
      "quoteHash": "0a441ec684675fc8389dbded09a2587d81894a3fc4cac6883a5a27bd3433f4eb",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-419f16d7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0018",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应建立和完善内部评级制度，采用科学合理的评级和授信方法，评定客户信用等级，建立客户资信记录。",
      "quoteHash": "419f16d77f0b4ce1e6002f3415e55f16edcaa619d4518a7df35fb4c6f1c0f2a3",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-8741c6a3",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0019",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应根据借款人经营规模、业务特征、资金循环周期等要素测算其营运资金需求（测算方法示例参考附件），并合理确定贷款结构，包括金额、期限、利率、担保和还款方式等。",
      "quoteHash": "8741c6a338256095710ea1e869fdd807214dfa51853c06e5bfd40144200de8fc",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-83887cc5",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0020",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应根据贷审分离、分级审批的原则，建立规范的流动资金贷款评审制度和流程，确保风险评价和信贷审批的独立性。",
      "quoteHash": "83887cc54d9bc6f317f1727a3b2b8fb995d71055471ca6a8912fae483ebc58f0",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-e7de9826",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0021",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人为股东等关联方办理流动资金贷款的，应严格执行关联交易管理的相关监管规定，发放贷款条件不得优于一般借款人，并在风险评价报告中进行说明。",
      "quoteHash": "e7de9826503c36f2766c14fa7adccd24b8f809939f5db2c879d503c56a9bd8b8",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-0be8fa4f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0023",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应在借款合同中与借款人明确约定流动资金贷款的金额、期限、利率、用途、支付、还款方式等条款。",
      "quoteHash": "0be8fa4fb7bad2e63891a5dc3838a4e65255224e935a7c9a484f4af66840e5c3",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PRICE",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-29354543",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0026",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应与借款人在合同中约定，出现以下情形之一时，借款人应承担的违约责任，以及贷款人可采取的提前收回贷款、调整贷款支付方式、调整贷款利率、收取罚息、压降授信额度、停止或中止贷款发放等措施，并追究相应法律责任：",
      "quoteHash": "2935454381420c232bc9da331f8db211f56694395790bdb6a9a34fef46c213ad",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-530d6928",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0028",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人在发放贷款前应确认借款人满足合同约定的提款条件，并按照合同约定通过贷款人受托支付或借款人自主支付的方式对贷款资金的支付进行管理与控制。贷款人应健全贷款资金支付管控体系，加强金融科技应用，有效监督贷款资金按约定用途使用。",
      "quoteHash": "530d6928fa63c59bf8a2c9eb43b3bc0c41b61b72ed3f5861a6f7e0c496636466",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-65d1962b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "在贷款发放或支付过程中，借款人出现以下情形的，贷款人应与借款人协商补充贷款发放和支付条件，或根据合同约定变更贷款支付方式、停止或中止贷款资金的发放和支付：",
      "quoteHash": "65d1962b83fe20d8e8639dbea12942d314b2888f3af0d7c09407c371c4513ed6",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-b5488bc9",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0035",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应加强贷款资金发放后的管理，针对借款人所属行业及经营特点，通过定期与不定期现场检查与非现场监测，分析借款人经营、财务、信用、支付、担保及融资数量和渠道变化等状况，掌握各种影响借款人偿债能力的风险因素。",
      "quoteHash": "b5488bc996acf1dbad12935667bfef0f76b4e601fed1dfff04ec301fd90b6f13",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-21daf5a4",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0039",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人应根据法律法规规定和借款合同的约定，参与借款人大额融资、资产出售以及兼并、分立、股份制改造、破产清算等活动，维护贷款人债权。",
      "quoteHash": "21daf5a403242a33b774ca1f5e5eb2b6f8ba287532f2fc8b0d93c3870c6ea155",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
      "sourceId": "REG-FIN-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-FIN-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGFIN001-20260922-dfa2dbff",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGFIN001-1e67bfc8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGFIN001-0042",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷款人违反本办法规定经营流动资金贷款业务的，国家金融监督管理总局及其派出机构应当责令其限期改正。贷款人有下列情形之一的，国家金融监督管理总局及其派出机构可根据《中华人民共和国银行业监督管理法》采取相关监管措施：",
      "quoteHash": "1e67bfc805427c9ebe84006f96e1f207ad49ab1d02909e726bccdaf376af9c9c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "dfa2dbff3746a7e20462178268e62bcb7626ba009a32389193afd3cd9bb4fdc5",
